:: Bloomshore Living Room
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-living-room", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
You stand in the living room. Grandma's things are neatly arranged; <<Caleb>>'s DAA jacket is draped over a chair.

<<icon "apartment-hall">><<link "Leave the living room <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Downstairs">><</link>>
